*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0012
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-01-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 874
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0012.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    05 CR-SCORE           PIC 9(3).
    *> GROSS ANNUAL INCOME
    05 GROSS-INCOME       PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> ASSIGNED CREDIT LIMIT
    05 CREDIT-LIMIT       PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM SET-CARD-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-LIMIT=" CREDIT-LIMIT
    STOP RUN.
SET-CARD-LIMIT.
    *> PRIME CREDIT LIMIT - LIMIT 375 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CR-SCORE >= 750
        COMPUTE CREDIT-LIMIT = GROSS-INCOME * 0.30
    *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT - LIMIT 990 PER 1998 POLICY
    ELSE IF CR-SCORE >= 660
        COMPUTE CREDIT-LIMIT ROUNDED = GROSS-INCOME * 0.15
    ELSE
        MOVE 500 TO CREDIT-LIMIT
    END-IF
    END-IF.
